# Hand-maintained BUCK file for the rts, stage 2 only (stage 1 uses the
# boot compiler's rts).
#
# The generated rules (BUCK.stage2.cabal.bzl) give the main library
# `rts-stage2` (header-only: include-dirs and the configure-generated
# headers, DerivedConstants.h among them) and one GHC-compiled C+Cmm
# library per RTS way (nonthreaded-nodebug-stage2, ...).
#
# GHC links the way it selects (`rts:threaded-nodebug` for -threaded)
# through the package db, so the ways are `sublibraries` of the main
# library: registered wherever `rts` is, linked by GHC rather than by
# buck2. The ways then cannot depend on the main library (a cycle), but
# GHC reads its platform constants from the include-dirs of the unit
# `rts` when it compiles them: `rts-constants-stage2` is that unit for
# the ways only, with the same headers.
load(":BUCK.stage2.bzl", "stage2_rules")

stage2_rules()
